    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "// BTC Flip Bot V3 \u2014 MTF Engulfing + SL-Flip + Pyramiding + Tuned Indicators (BTCUSDT 1H)"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "// Tested ONLY on BTCUSDT | 1H | requires 4\u00d7 exchange leverage ceiling."
